Z||000004||DaRkLoRD||08-26-99||11:34 PM||||I have fun on this forum.. it's great!<p>people joke around, help each other with problems, etc.. but one thing we don't do is have flame wars and fights and stuff. I've seen too much of that on the net in the past 3-4 years. There are a few cars I don't like either, but it's not worth my time to rant and rave about them here, nor is it worth the time of the other people on the forum.<p>Many of my friends don't like Fieros at all. I listen to them insulting them, calling them pieces of junk, saying they look ugly, I don't insult the cars they like.. in fact tonight I showed some friends a photo of an awesome red fiero GT (fastback, new wheels, side scoops) and one of them said there's no way that's a Fiero.. I said yes, that's what Fieros look like! He didn't believe me.. he'd been insulting them for years and didn't even know what they looked like.<p>This forum is great, and I think it's really cool how so many people contribute to the different discussions and everyone gets along so good. If you don't like some type of car, that's fine, everyone has things they don't like. I just don't think complaining about something you don't like is considered "fun".. Fun is laughing at the Mustangs and other "sports cars" that you beat with a totally stock car that's over 10 years old!! <p><IMG SRC="/ubb/smile.gif" WIDTH=15 HEIGHT=15>
